env

# Real environment files & secrets (keep only the template)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Offline-only files: the service loads the static artifacts/ model and never trains or reads datasets at runtime.
# (artifacts/model.joblib, metadata.json and evaluation_report.json are intentionally kept.)
tests
data
training
**/*.md
**/*.log

# Docker build files
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
